    { "do": "wait", "note": "ADP 1 が APU の空気で回る（AUTO：FUEL CONTROL 1 が CUTOFF。FCOM p.1483）", "dref": "laminar/B747/hydraulics/dem_pressure_1", "op": ">", "value": 2800, "timeout": 20 },
